      ],
      "size": [
        360,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Downscale Prep for FLUX.2 / Qwen-Image-Edit (~1 MP)\n\nUse this workflow when you **already generated a high-res (2K/4K) character or background you love** and want to merge them in FLUX.2 or Qwen-Image-Edit without slow multi-image compute.\n\n## Why downscale instead of regenerating?\n- Regenerating with the same seed at a lower resolution changes the latent shape and produces a **different face/pose/outfit**.\n- Downscaling preserves **100% of your exact character**, runs in under 1 second, and looks clean/supersampled with `area` resampling.\n\n## Modes (`USE EXACT WIDTH/HEIGHT?` switch)\n- **OFF (default \u2014 recommended):** Automatically scales any image to **`1.0 MP`** snapped to multiples of **`64`**, keeping its exact aspect ratio:\n  - `9:16` character (e.g. 2160\u00d73840) \u2192 **`768\u00d71344`**\n  - `16:9` background (e.g. 3840\u00d72160) \u2192 **`1344\u00d7768`**\n  - `1:1` square (e.g. 2048\u00d72048) \u2192 **`1024\u00d71024`**\n- **ON (Exact dimensions):** Forces exact `Target WIDTH \u00d7 Target HEIGHT` (with `center` crop if aspect ratios differ). Useful if you need exact `1344\u00d7768` (16:9) or `768\u00d71344` (9:16).\n\nSaves a clean lossless PNG in `ComfyUI/output/Image_Prep_1MP_*.png`.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Downscale Prep for FLUX.2 / Qwen-Image-Edit (~1 MP)\n\nUse this workflow when you **already generated a high-res (2K/4K) character or background you love** and want to merge them in FLUX.2 or Qwen-Image-Edit without slow multi-image compute.\n\n## Why downscale instead of regenerating?\n- Regenerating with the same seed at a lower resolution changes the latent shape and produces a **different face/pose/outfit**.\n- Downscaling preserves **100% of your exact character**, runs in under 1 second, and looks clean/supersampled with `area` resampling.\n\n## Modes (`USE EXACT WIDTH/HEIGHT?` switch)\n- **OFF (default \u2014 recommended):** Automatically scales any image to **`1.0 MP`** snapped to multiples of **`64`**, keeping its exact aspect ratio:\n  - `9:16` character (e.g. 2160\u00d73840) \u2192 **`768\u00d71344`**\n  - `16:9` background (e.g. 3840\u00d72160) \u2192 **`1344\u00d7768`**\n  - `1:1` square (e.g. 2048\u00d72048) \u2192 **`1024\u00d71024`**\n- **ON (Exact dimensions):** Forces exact `Target WIDTH \u00d7 Target HEIGHT` (with `center` crop if aspect ratios differ). Useful if you need exact `1344\u00d7768` (16:9) or `768\u00d71344` (9:16).\n\nSaves a clean lossless PNG in `ComfyUI/output/Image_Prep_1MP_*.png`.\n"
      },
      "title": "HOW TO: Downscale Prep (~1 MP)",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
